PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F163A1792327683
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sun 1 Nov to Sun 15 Nov
OL,6,FThis period is highly uncertain, more
OL,7,Fso than normal, but overall it seems
OL,8,Fmore likely than not that the UK
OL,9,Fweather will be dominated by westerly
OL,10,For southwesterly winds from the
OL,11,FAtlantic during this period, with
OL,12,Fareas of potentially deep low pressure
OL,13,Foften affecting the UK at times. This
OL,14,Fwill result in spells of wet and windy
OL,15,Fweather followed by drier but still
OL,16,Fshowery interludes. Stormy conditions
OL,17,Fare also possible at times. High
OL,18,Fpressure may attempt to build across
OL,19,Fthe country at times, this perhaps
OL,20,Fmore likely early in the period, but
OL,21,Fany settled spells are likely to be
OL,22,Fshort-lived. Temperatures are likely
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fto be near or a little above average
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Foverall.
FL,164,160,301,260,100,100
